"""Generates config/catalog.json: the curated queue of supplements added by automatic coverage
expansion (N per run, in this order). Edit this file and re-run it, or edit catalog.json directly.

Each entry = PubMed search + title topic regex + 2-4 outcomes from the shared outcome library.
Outcome rules decide which reported effect sizes count for an outcome; nothing is estimated.
"""
